c>will </c><00:00:01.555><c>be </c><00:00:01.556><c>some </c><00:00:01.557><c>freedom </c><00:00:01.558><c>as  </c><00:00:01.559><c>to </c><00:00:01.560><c>what </c><00:00:01.561><c>approaches </c><00:00:01.562><c>one </c><00:00:01.563><c>might </c><00:00:01.564><c>take</c>

